  "description": "Azure Blob Storage ILatticeBackupSink for Orleans.Lattice.Backup. Persists backup manifests as block blobs and backup artifacts as append blobs of length-framed chunks (one blob per capture's artifact) in an Azure Storage container, so backups are durable off-cluster. Registered through DI in place of the in-cluster default sink; the capture and restore engines stay unaware of Azure specifics.",
